  "description": "All Margo wanted was some peace and quiet, even if she had to kill her husband to get it. She thought she’d gotten away with it too. She never expected the snowstorm or to be trapped in her house with suspicious eyes watching her every move. Margo’s fate lies in the hands of a strange maid, Peggy, who catches her in the act of destroying evidence. But what will Margo do when the touch of those hands makes her tremble with pleasure? Will she find her respite, or be forced to kill again?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
